00:37:05.000 --> 00:37:48.000
myths and your stories by embedding them in public space. So you began investigating these lost cause memorials. How did you go about investigating how public funds were used to maintain and promote these sort of ahistoric sites? So how do we go about this? First, we had to differentiate between the sites that were doing real, honest, genuine historic work and those that were promoting ideology. So we did a lot of our searching on the web first, and we talked to people in the places where these monuments and sites were.

59
00:37:48.000 --> 00:38:40.000
